# Fractal Tender: the stun counter Bot2's Fractal Mascot puts on it (after Bot2 pays ward {2}) is a counter Bot2 put, not one "you
# put" (CR 122.6), so Bot1 gets no Fractal at the end step although the Tender has a counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fractal Tender
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Fractal Mascot
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Island x20

